  "Description": "Connects each start point with a target point by a line that walks along the axes of a grid, e.g. for circuit or Manhattan-style connection effects.\n\nEach connection has 11 points and is followed by a separator. Draw the result with [DrawLines].\n\nSee also: [PairPointsForLines], [PairPointsForSplines]",
